BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:csocd-2027-01-17-csocd-youth-resolution-zero-draft-input@unyd-process-guide
DTSTAMP:20260829T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270117
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270118
SUMMARY:[Planning] CSocD: CSocD youth-resolution zero-draft input
LOCATION:New York
DESCRIPTION:Austrian UN Youth Delegates sent comments on the CSocD63 resolution on policies and programmes involving youth to the officials coordinating Austria’s position on 17 January 2025. The exact draft-circulation and internal-deadline dates were not recovered and are therefore not projected.\nStatus: recent cycle. The sequence separates general priority-setting before the zero draft from clause-specific recommendations after it arrives. January timing uses the documented 2025 CSocD youth-resolution cycle as an early-warning pattern\, not a fixed CSocD rule.\nOfficial process source: https://social.desa.un.org/csocd/65th-session
URL:https://social.desa.un.org/csocd/65th-session
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
