UID:csw-2027-01-27-draft-circulation-and-internal-deadline@unyd-process-guide
DTSTAMP:20260829T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270127
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270130
SUMMARY:[Planning] CSW: Draft circulation and internal deadline
LOCATION:New York
DESCRIPTION:In the documented 2025 Austrian cycle\, the draft circulated on 27 January and comments were due on 29 January. The 2027 dates are not yet published.\nStatus: recent cycle. Three routes are shown separately: the formal Agreed Conclusions route through the responsible ministry or the country’s Permanent Mission in New York\; repeated recent-cycle youth-recommendation and UN Women coordination\; and the annual CSW Youth Forum. Only the first route provides access to the intergovernmental draft.\nOfficial process source: https://www.unwomen.org/en/how-we-work/commission-on-the-status-of-women
URL:https://www.unwomen.org/en/how-we-work/commission-on-the-status-of-women
END:VEVENT
