LOCATION:New York
DESCRIPTION:The 2023 Summit precedent placed the zero draft on 8 May. The 2027 co-facilitators have not yet published a timetable.\nStatus: recent cycle. Because 2027 is an SDG Summit year\, the ordinary July ministerial-declaration sequence is not projected. The political-declaration bars use the 2023 Summit cycle only as a precedent\; the 2027 co-facilitator timetable is still pending.\nOfficial process source: https://hlpf.un.org/
URL:https://hlpf.un.org/
