DESCRIPTION:Official session dates: 14 June–9 July 2027.\nStatus: official. There is no single annual HRC zero draft. Until a session-specific report\, panel\, resolution consultation or submission deadline is published\, the calendar shows only the three official regular sessions\; recurring youth and child-rights entry points remain described below.\nOfficial process source: https://hrcportal.ohchr.org/hrc-sessions
URL:https://hrcportal.ohchr.org/hrc-sessions
END:VEVENT
